sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Compose UI / ViewModel
    participant Svc as TeamSpeakService
    participant Gate as SessionGenerationGate
    participant Client as Ts3jSessionClient (Facade)
    participant UDP as TeamSpeak Server (UDP)

    UI->>Svc: Connect(Host, Port, Nickname)
    Svc->>Gate: begin { nextToken }
    Gate-->>Svc: Token = Epoch_N
    Svc->>Client: connect(Config, Token)
    Client->>UDP: UDP Handshake & Login
    alt Connection Success
        UDP-->>Client: onConnected & Snapshot Events
        Client->>Gate: withCurrent(Token)
        Gate-->>Client: Allowed
        Client->>Svc: onStatusChanged(CONNECTED)
        Svc->>UI: StateFlow Update
    else Stale Event from Epoch_(N-1)
        UDP-->>Client: Disconnect from previous session
        Client->>Gate: withCurrent(Epoch_N-1)
        Gate-->>Client: Rejected (Null)
        Note over Client: Dropped safely, no UI pollution
    end
